  "body": "Welcome to an easy-care family haven in one of East Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs. Beautifully presented and thoughtfully designed, this home brings together comfort, practicality and an enviable location, creating an ideal lifestyle for families wanting room to grow, everyday convenience and access to some of the area's most desirable schools.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a 334m2 (more or less) freehold site, this substantial three-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers generous proportions while remaining easy to maintain.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is designed for effortless living, with excellent connection between the indoors and outdoors. A spacious lounge provides a relaxed setting for everyday life, while the open-plan kitchen and dining area form the social heart of the home. Bathed in natural light, this inviting space opens through sliding doors to a sunny deck and fully fenced garden - perfect for summer entertaining, family gatherings or simply enjoying your morning coffee. A bathroom and powder room add further practicality to this level. Upstairs, three well-proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, including a peaceful master retreat with semi-ensuite access.\r\n\r\nYear-round comfort is well catered for with central air conditioning, underfloor heating in the kitchen and bathrooms, two heat pumps, and an HRV Moisture Master system. Upstairs, the bathroom features a relaxing spa bath, while the deck is fitted with an awning for added shade and protection from the sun. The double internal-access garage offers secure parking and excellent storage, complemented by additional off-street and on-street parking for family and guests.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the highly sought-after school zoning for Bucklands Beach Primary, BBI Intermediate and Macleans College. When it's time to unwind, Bucklands Beach, Eastern Beach and the marina are all just minutes away, offering endless opportunities for weekend walks, beach days and family adventures. Howick Village is also a short drive away, with boutique shopping, cafes, restaurants and its welcoming village atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a home - it's an opportunity to secure a relaxed family lifestyle in a tightly held coastal neighbourhood. The vendor has purchased elsewhere and is committed to moving forward so this property must be sold at auction.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vish today for more information and make sure you don't miss this opportunity.\r\n\r\n* Find more properties you may like at - https://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
